artifacts/codex-runs/firmware-compliance-gate-terminal.log:76345:+The firmware compliance gate runs before major configuration workflows. It
artifacts/codex-runs/firmware-compliance-gate-terminal.log:76346:+loads the baseline from `config/firmware-baselines/real-lab.yml`, collects
artifacts/codex-runs/firmware-compliance-gate-terminal.log:76347:+available iLO/Cisco/NetApp firmware and OS evidence, scans local media metadata
artifacts/codex-runs/firmware-compliance-gate-terminal.log:76349:+under `artifacts/codex-runs/`. It does not upload, flash, reboot for firmware,
artifacts/codex-runs/firmware-compliance-gate-terminal.log:76350:+or update firmware.
